1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:05,961
Oh snap, look at that smooth transition. Hello guys and welcome back to the room I'm staying in.
哇，这个转场真顺。大家好，欢迎回到我住的房间。

2
00:00:05,961 --> 00:00:10,991
It is several days later, but I'm wearing the same outfit to try to convincingly look like I filmed this all in one day.
其实过了几天，但我穿着同一套，想让人觉得是一天拍完的。

3
00:00:11,001 --> 00:00:20,041
When in reality the sun sets at 4:30 p.m. and I wake up around noon, so I only have like four hours of sunlight to film anything, which is why it's taking me so damn long to make this video.
其实太阳四点半就落山，我又中午才起，每天只有四小时日光能拍，所以拍得特别慢。

4
00:00:20,041 --> 00:00:25,001
So first up I thought I would show you guys what I got from Trade, which is the last store that I went to.
先给大家看看在最后一家店淘到了什么。

5
00:00:25,001 --> 00:00:31,801
This was the most affordable store that I got anything from, so I'm the most excited about it because I feel like it is the true spirit of thrift shopping.
这是这次买到东西的店里最实惠的一家，所以我最兴奋，感觉这才有淘旧衣的乐趣。

6
00:00:31,801 --> 00:00:41,241
Where I actually am like proud that I found something that was really affordable versus some of this other stuff which was just like ungodly expensive, but I paid for it anyways because I am a vintage hoe.
淘到实惠好物会很有成就感，不像另外一些贵得夸张的东西，可我太爱复古了，还是买了。

7
00:00:41,281 --> 00:00:44,721
I also picked up this denim midi skirt from Goldsmith Vintage.
我还买了这条复古店里的牛仔中长裙。

8
00:00:44,721 --> 00:00:47,441
I have been looking for a denim midi skirt for a really long time.
我已经找这种牛仔中长裙找很久了。

9
00:00:47,441 --> 00:00:54,881
I have been wearing the same denim miniskirt from Brandy Melville for probably five years at this point, and I still really love that skirt.
那条牛仔短裙大概已经穿了五年，现在还是很喜欢。

10
00:00:54,881 --> 00:01:06,400
But I like that this one is a little more structured and conservative, and it feels less like I'm, you know, a 13 year old VSCO girl, and a little bit more like fashion blogger slash 80s mom.
不过这条更有型，也更保守一点，少了稚嫩的感觉，多了点时尚博主和八十年代妈妈的风格。

11
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:13,041
It also fits me really well around the waist. It's that nice, like high quality Vince denim that's tough but broken in.
腰部也很合身，牛仔布很有质感，结实但已经穿软了。

12
00:01:13,041 --> 00:01:16,961
So it's like tough and soft at the same time, like a good man. Nope.
就是又结实又柔软，像个好男人——好吧，收回这个比喻。

13
00:01:16,961 --> 00:01:25,521
Okay, lastly I got two things from, I forget the name of the store but I'll insert it over here, the other second hand shop that I went to.
最后，在另一家二手店还买了两件，名字忘了，会放在画面里。

14
00:01:25,521 --> 00:01:30,881
I picked up this light pink cardigan for 10 pounds. I thought it was a pretty good price for a nice basic piece.
这件浅粉色开衫花了十镑，作为基础款，我觉得价格不错。

15
00:01:30,881 --> 00:01:39,761
To be fair, I think this is something that you could pretty easily find at like a Goodwill or Salvation Army in America too, for probably like a couple dollars cheaper than what I got it for.
公平说，这类开衫在美国的旧物店可能也不难找到，还可能便宜几块钱。

16
00:01:39,761 --> 00:01:44,241
But I really like the color. I've been seeing a lot of girls on Instagram styling these cardigans as well.
不过我很喜欢这个颜色，也看到不少人在 Instagram 上搭这种开衫。

17
00:01:44,241 --> 00:01:53,041
Either like buttoned all the way up and tucked into high waisted jeans, or I've seen people style them where they only button up the top couple buttons and then they leave the rest unbuttoned.
有的全扣起来塞进高腰牛仔裤，有的只扣上面几颗，下面敞开。

18
00:01:53,041 --> 00:01:58,801
So it's a little like sexy grandma moment. Anyways I got this cardigan, great.
就有点俏皮的复古奶奶风。总之，这件开衫买下了。

19
00:01:58,801 --> 00:02:05,431
And then lastly I got this corset dress. I caved. This was 50 pounds.
最后还买了这条束身设计的连衣裙。我没忍住，花了五十镑。

20
00:02:05,441 --> 00:02:16,551
Um, but it's by the brand Temporally, which I'm going to assume is some type of designer brand because it says the estimated retail price was a thousand three hundred pounds.
标签上的牌子我不太熟，估计是设计师品牌，因为估计原零售价写着一千三百镑。

21
00:02:16,561 --> 00:02:21,121
Although maybe that's just a lie to make me feel better about spending 50 pounds on a vintage dress.
不过，也可能只是让我觉得这五十镑花得更值得。

22
00:02:21,121 --> 00:02:30,321
Regardless, I just thought it was such a cool design. I have never seen a corset detail like this before, and I just fell in love with it.
不管怎样，我觉得设计很特别，从没见过这样的束身细节，一下就喜欢上了。

23
00:02:30,321 --> 00:02:35,761
However it does not fit me perfectly right now, so I am gonna have to do a little alteration magic.
不过现在不算完全合身，需要施一点改衣魔法。

24
00:02:35,761 --> 00:02:40,241
I'm gonna take in about an inch from the sides so it hugs my waist a little bit better.
我会从两侧收进大约一英寸，让腰部更贴合。

25
00:02:40,241 --> 00:02:45,521
And then I'm gonna take out the bottom of this dress so it's a mini dress instead of the current midi length.
然后调整裙摆，把现在的中长款改成短裙。

26
00:02:45,521 --> 00:02:48,801
I think it'll look a lot more current and a lot more flattering on my body.
我觉得那样会更时髦，也更适合我的身形。

27
00:02:48,801 --> 00:02:52,231
Um, so I'm really excited to see how this turns out after I flip it.
很期待改完会是什么效果。

28
00:02:52,241 --> 00:02:58,561
All right, that is everything I got. Sorry, like some of this stuff is a lot more expensive than what you would find in thrift stores in America.
好了，这就是全部收获。有些确实比美国旧衣店里常见的贵。

29
00:02:58,561 --> 00:03:04,390
I feel like normally the fun part of thrift balls for people is being like, oh my God, she got that for only three dollars.
我感觉大家看淘衣分享的乐趣，常是惊叹某件只花了三块钱。

30
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:14,411
Unfortunately, shit's just pricey here in London. Anyways I hope you guys enjoyed this video. Thank you for watching. I will see you guys next week. Bye.
可惜这次在伦敦感觉什么都贵。希望你喜欢这支视频，谢谢观看，下周见。
